    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Final Exam</strong> is a cooperative horror game for 1-4 players, Where you will explore this complex and intricate dimension with your friends or alone, trying to figure out what to do, wandering around and being scared by every sound, you will need to pass your final exam, whether you can do it or not is up to you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>- Scary atmosphere!<br>- 1 to 4 player co-op<br>- Proximity voice chat<br>- Immersive AI<br>- Game Difficulties<br>- Stealth<br>- Large &amp; difficult map<br>- Primitive but challenging gameplay<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2>This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way.<br><br>The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>",
